And this week we chose the letter C because I'll answer emails about Meribadge

61
00:03:42,520 --> 00:03:47,920
classes, patrols cooking their own chow, a scoutmaster a little worried about scouts

62
00:03:47,920 --> 00:03:58,160
who change troops, and an email about Scouting's Urban Legends or Scouting's Chimeras-

63
00:03:58,160 --> 00:04:00,160
I told you it was tortured-

64
00:04:00,160 --> 00:04:05,960
